(7624199, 1235380, 30364, '<td valign="top">On the podium.  Third place only, but the other two were even more inexplicable than yours, so you can''t complain. Of the three, yours is the most beautifully photographed craft-wise.  But I don''t care about that so it doesn''t count.  It''s still the bronze medal for you, then. But should the other two get disqualified, which of course would be splendid, you are perfectly placed to pounce.<br/>Thank you.</td>', 'On the podium.  Third place only, but the other two were even more inexplicable than yours, so you can''t complain. Of the three, yours is the most beautifully photographed craft-wise.  But I don''t care about that so it doesn''t count.  It''s still the bronze medal for you, then. But should the other two get disqualified, which of course would be splendid, you are perfectly placed to pounce.Thank you.', '2019-04-11 06:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624200, 1235239, 30364, '<td valign="top">There is a guy (black guy) up in the top right corner scowling at the Giraffe in the Hat. And another guy (white guy) upside-down kissing the first guy on the eye socket.  The guy in the back part of the giraffe suit seems too short for the role. The wardrobe guy has done the guy (tall skinny guy) in the front half of the giraffe suit no favours, leaving his fedora on like that; it destroys the whole effect of the trick. This photograph seems a bit rickety.  I think you needed some guy-wires.<br/>Thank you.</td>', 'There is a guy (black guy) up in the top right corner scowling at the Giraffe in the Hat. And another guy (white guy) upside-down kissing the first guy on the eye socket.  The guy in the back part of the giraffe suit seems too short for the role. The wardrobe guy has done the guy (tall skinny guy) in the front half of the giraffe suit no favours, leaving his fedora on like that; it destroys the whole effect of the trick. This photograph seems a bit rickety.  I think you needed some guy-wires.Thank you.', '2019-04-11 06:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
