(7624499, 1235173, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s the  internal struggle of how appropriate it is to keep birds in cages - and I''ve been caught up in it with the parakeets I''ve had, especially the last two who''ve had trouble flying and basically stayed within all their lives.  Beyond this, and it''s no small matter, this is, visually, utterly charming.  One of two personal favorites of the challenge and I''ve given it a ten.</td>', 'There''s the  internal struggle of how appropriate it is to keep birds in cages - and I''ve been caught up in it with the parakeets I''ve had, especially the last two who''ve had trouble flying and basically stayed within all their lives.  Beyond this, and it''s no small matter, this is, visually, utterly charming.  One of two personal favorites of the challenge and I''ve given it a ten.', '2019-04-14 09:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624500, 1235399, 173844, '<td valign="top">An awesome image, so dark, busy and jumbled that the beauty that emerges from it all is stunning.  The mood is wonderful, the steady rain, the hubbub of wires, the behind the scene intimacy.  This would be some stage set.  It wouldn''t succeed half as well if it were not in black and white.  Hits the spot.  One of two personal favorites of the challenge - 10.  Thanks for the peek into this moment.</td>', 'An awesome image, so dark, busy and jumbled that the beauty that emerges from it all is stunning.  The mood is wonderful, the steady rain, the hubbub of wires, the behind the scene intimacy.  This would be some stage set.  It wouldn''t succeed half as well if it were not in black and white.  Hits the spot.  One of two personal favorites of the challenge - 10.  Thanks for the peek into this moment.', '2019-04-14 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624501, 1235332, 173844, '<td valign="top">The flamboyant exuberance of this sunset is marvelous.  Not to ignore the excellent sea and setting sun, but the clouds are a buoyant showstopper.  They''re like an enormous bird, swan or phoenix, swooping in to overwhelm us with boundless power and subtlety.  The angle of the shore to the horizon helps establish a strong composition.  Fine image.</td>', 'The flamboyant exuberance of this sunset is marvelous.  Not to ignore the excellent sea and setting sun, but the clouds are a buoyant showstopper.  They''re like an enormous bird, swan or phoenix, swooping in to overwhelm us with boundless power and subtlety.  The angle of the shore to the horizon helps establish a strong composition.  Fine image.', '2019-04-14 09:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624502, 1235346, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely swooping lines.  I like when a photographer is unafraid of large swaths of darkness in an image, as here on the left, which does also happen to include a lot of revealing tonality.  I also appreciate the emptiness, but for the person on the bottom who''s sort of an apostrophe within the scene.  Impressive.</td>', 'Lovely swooping lines.  I like when a photographer is unafraid of large swaths of darkness in an image, as here on the left, which does also happen to include a lot of revealing tonality.  I also appreciate the emptiness, but for the person on the bottom who''s sort of an apostrophe within the scene.  Impressive.', '2019-04-14 09:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624503, 1235362, 173844, '<td valign="top">An epitome of the wonder of childhood.  A little one, beautiful of course, utterly in the moment.  And the hand (don''t know if girl or boy) is a joy of awkward exploration and discovery.  Wonderful portrait.</td>', 'An epitome of the wonder of childhood.  A little one, beautiful of course, utterly in the moment.  And the hand (don''t know if girl or boy) is a joy of awkward exploration and discovery.  Wonderful portrait.', '2019-04-14 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624505, 1235328, 173844, '<td valign="top">By now, one''s face is but a palimpsest of that long journey.  I''ll speculate he''s a sensitive man.  He seems to be both looking outward and inward.  This portrait is so successful because it appears to show all, but also acknowledges  the hidden wellspring.</td>', 'By now, one''s face is but a palimpsest of that long journey.  I''ll speculate he''s a sensitive man.  He seems to be both looking outward and inward.  This portrait is so successful because it appears to show all, but also acknowledges  the hidden wellspring.', '2019-04-14 09:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624506, 1235366, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait of this young woman in a moment of thought.  Is she about to make a call or has she just finished one?  It''s a provocative point of mystery, allowing for flights of fancy.  She''s settled into her environment, but is dramatically poised.  It''s well-composed.  The flurry of lights introduces an unexpected touch of whimsy.  The strong sepia tone is a good choice.</td>', 'Fine portrait of this young woman in a moment of thought.  Is she about to make a call or has she just finished one?  It''s a provocative point of mystery, allowing for flights of fancy.  She''s settled into her environment, but is dramatically poised.  It''s well-composed.  The flurry of lights introduces an unexpected touch of whimsy.  The strong sepia tone is a good choice.', '2019-04-14 09:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624507, 1235282, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine example of the beauty and infinite variety of tree bark.</td>', 'A fine example of the beauty and infinite variety of tree bark.', '2019-04-14 09:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624508, 1234996, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great aerial view of what seems to be, though of course it isn''t, a mechanical free for all. It''s a landscape and geology of its own.  The contrast of light and dark is excellent, as is the depiction of wear and tear.  I''d hate to be a bug lost in there.</td>', 'Great aerial view of what seems to be, though of course it isn''t, a mechanical free for all. It''s a landscape and geology of its own.  The contrast of light and dark is excellent, as is the depiction of wear and tear.  I''d hate to be a bug lost in there.', '2019-04-14 09:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624509, 1235364, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine study of a rose boldly washed of its tell-tale color.  We''re left with a more interesting paean to structure, shape, tone and texture.  Usually it''s the heady aroma that draws one in, but here the visual whirlpool does the same.  Revelatory.</td>', 'Fine study of a rose boldly washed of its tell-tale color.  We''re left with a more interesting paean to structure, shape, tone and texture.  Usually it''s the heady aroma that draws one in, but here the visual whirlpool does the same.  Revelatory.', '2019-04-14 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624510, 1235387, 173844, '<td valign="top">Engaging portrait of these young men who look so much alike.  They seem to be sweet and genuine.  It''s an unusual pose, but it works completely.  It''s just so heartening to see people like them.</td>', 'Engaging portrait of these young men who look so much alike.  They seem to be sweet and genuine.  It''s an unusual pose, but it works completely.  It''s just so heartening to see people like them.', '2019-04-14 09:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624511, 1235378, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s already hot in Arizona, but OMG!  Can the sun be that huge?  In what wavelength was this taken?  I like the sci-fi, over-the-top-ness of this image.  This desert, so beautiful and distinctive, can certainly seem other-worldly to some, but fortunate are those who call it home.  Unique and mesmerizing.</td>', 'It''s already hot in Arizona, but OMG!  Can the sun be that huge?  In what wavelength was this taken?  I like the sci-fi, over-the-top-ness of this image.  This desert, so beautiful and distinctive, can certainly seem other-worldly to some, but fortunate are those who call it home.  Unique and mesmerizing.', '2019-04-14 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624512, 1234931, 173844, '<td valign="top">Everyday moment, okay, but shown as luminous and a bit mysterious.  The lightness of being, the unnameable.  Happy to be here.</td>', 'Everyday moment, okay, but shown as luminous and a bit mysterious.  The lightness of being, the unnameable.  Happy to be here.', '2019-04-14 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624513, 1234891, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is this seen through something sort of transparent, is it a reflection, or what?  In any case it''s interesting and evocative, vegetation like mountains under an equivocal sky.  Partial yet satisfying, and I like it just fine.</td>', 'Is this seen through something sort of transparent, is it a reflection, or what?  In any case it''s interesting and evocative, vegetation like mountains under an equivocal sky.  Partial yet satisfying, and I like it just fine.', '2019-04-14 09:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7624514, 1235352, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sun-drenched, the brilliance of white, the composition, the shapes, shadows, stolid figures, the handrail, the holy grails.  Very nice.  An impressive flash of insight.</td>', 'Sun-drenched, the brilliance of white, the composition, the shapes, shadows, stolid figures, the handrail, the holy grails.  Very nice.  An impressive flash of insight.', '2019-04-14 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
