(7624725, 1235329, 114285, '<td valign="top">You always come up with some quirky titles, well not always but most of the time :-)  dont want to give you a big head ha ha.<br/> <br/> Congratulations   on the top five, a very sweet image.</td>', 'You always come up with some quirky titles, well not always but most of the time :-)  dont want to give you a big head ha ha.  Congratulations   on the top five, a very sweet image.', '2019-04-15 04:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7624727, 1235239, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> There is a guy (black guy) up in the top right corner scowling at the Giraffe in the Hat. And another guy (white guy) upside-down kissing the first guy on the eye socket.  The guy in the back part of the giraffe suit seems too short for the role. The wardrobe guy has done the guy (tall skinny guy) in the front half of the giraffe suit no favours, leaving his fedora on like that; it destroys the whole effect of the trick. This photograph seems a bit rickety.  I think you needed some guy-wires.<br/>Thank you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I can see it now. Thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: There is a guy (black guy) up in the top right corner scowling at the Giraffe in the Hat. And another guy (white guy) upside-down kissing the first guy on the eye socket.  The guy in the back part of the giraffe suit seems too short for the role. The wardrobe guy has done the guy (tall skinny guy) in the front half of the giraffe suit no favours, leaving his fedora on like that; it destroys the whole effect of the trick. This photograph seems a bit rickety.  I think you needed some guy-wires.Thank you.  I can see it now. Thank you.', '2019-04-15 04:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7624729, 1235173, 61396, '<td valign="top">That Ricoh of yours</td>', 'That Ricoh of yours', '2019-04-15 05:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7624730, 1235313, 135744, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog portrait! There is no way I could get my dogs to sit still like that. Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Beautiful dog portrait! There is no way I could get my dogs to sit still like that. Congrats on the blue!', '2019-04-15 05:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7624731, 1235303, 135744, '<td valign="top">Very nice to see a dandelion presented in such a creative way. Congrats!</td>', 'Very nice to see a dandelion presented in such a creative way. Congrats!', '2019-04-15 05:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
